 "provenance": "Bavaria 5 (w1 l4) normal exit 40,29, control-only on the exact S700 core. Start values: lives 12 (campaign-style value used by the earlier certified routes), weaponTier 2 (the hook is obtained in Bavaria 3, so Bavaria 4+ start with it), maxHealth 4 (the default: no armour bought, same as the other Bavaria routes), diamonds/redDiamonds 0 (irrelevant: the magic diamond lock tile 39,29 is cleared at load in this S700 build). Route: walk to checkpoint 10,8 along the same cells as the old port attempt bavaria-05-first-checkpoint (114 ticks). Diamond 5,7 collected and grass 4,7 hammered so the roller 3,7 rolls along row 7 and drops onto crusher 7,9-10, destroying it; silver key chest 9,10. Lower-left room through bridge 10,23: switch 6,24 (row-25 bridge opens and row-28 bridge closes; stones 4,24/8,24 fall through row 25 onto the snakes at 4,27/8,27 and crush both), switch 6,26 (row 28 reopens), silver key chest 6,29, switches 6,26 and 6,24 again (all bridges back to their initial state). Silver locks 15,15 and 15,16 open gate 15,17. Riddle room 0 (trigger 16,17): grass 21,13 hammered behind the crawler, which walks above torch 21,15 and solves the riddle (gates 15,17/26,16 reopen); checkpoints 17,17 and 27,10. Grass 30,8-10 hammered, the column-30 stones drop and the hook pulls one to 29,9, opening column 30. Row 5 crossed under spears 32,3/35,3/38,3 in safe phases; checkpoint 40,7; diamonds 35-38,7. Hook pulls stone 33,9 (it lands on 35,10), a second hook moves it along row 10 and it is pushed onto plate 39,10 (gate 41,10 opens). Riddle room 1 (trigger 38,14, checkpoint 37,14): two hooks from 36,13 clear the stones above torch 33,14 and the crawler lights it (gates 39,14/38,16 reopen). Snakes of the right column passed in safe phases; checkpoint 27,22; gold key chest 16,29; grass column 37 to 37,28 uses the key on gold lock 38,28; gate 38,29; exit 40,29. No damage, no deaths, no resets.",
